                <formatted-text>
                  <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='7'>* Target MTD comes from a daily target which is derived from the Target / RunRate seasonality on the 1st of the month</run>
                  <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='7'>* Data labels in the bar charts above reflect this year&apos;s Actual MTD figures and this year&apos;s Target MTD figures. Last year&apos;s Actual MTD figures (narrow pink bars) are not labelled</run>
                  <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='7'>*  CC = Constant Currency.</run>
                </formatted-text>
